            {
              "id": "CVE-2023-44487-libnghttp2-14",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2023-44487 high vulnerability for libnghttp2-14 package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The HTTP/2 protocol allows a denial of service (server resource consumption) because request cancellation can reset many streams quickly, as exploited in the wild in August through October 2023."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2023-44487\nSeverity: high\nPackage: libnghttp2-14\nVersion: 1.36.0-2+deb10u1\nFix Version: 1.36.0-2+deb10u2\nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:10\nLink: [CVE-2023-44487](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2023-44487)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2023-44487**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | libnghttp2-14  | 1.36.0-2+deb10u1  | 1.36.0-2+deb10u2  | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:10  | [CVE-2023-44487](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2023-44487)  |\n"
