            {
              "id": "CVE-2009-3546-libwmf-dev",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2009-3546 medium vulnerability for libwmf-dev package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The _gdGetColors function in gd_gd.c in PHP 5.2.11 and 5.3.x before 5.3.1, and the GD Graphics Library 2.x, does not properly verify a certain colorsTotal structure member, which might allow remote attackers to conduct buffer overflow or buffer over-read attacks via a crafted GD file, a different vulnerability than CVE-2009-3293. NOTE: some of these details are obtained from third party information."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
