            {
              "id": "CVE-2023-25652-git",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2023-25652 high vulnerability for git package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Git is a revision control system. Prior to versions 2.30.9, 2.31.8, 2.32.7, 2.33.8, 2.34.8, 2.35.8, 2.36.6, 2.37.7, 2.38.5, 2.39.3, and 2.40.1, by feeding specially crafted input to `git apply --reject`, a path outside the working tree can be overwritten with partially controlled contents (corresponding to the rejected hunk(s) from the given patch). A fix is available in versions 2.30.9, 2.31.8, 2.32.7, 2.33.8, 2.34.8, 2.35.8, 2.36.6, 2.37.7, 2.38.5, 2.39.3, and 2.40.1. As a workaround, avoid using `git apply` with `--reject` when applying patches from an untrusted source. Use `git apply --stat` to inspect a patch before applying; avoid applying one that create a conflict where a link corresponding to the `*.rej` file exists."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2023-25652\nSeverity: high\nPackage: git\nVersion: 1:2.20.1-2+deb10u8\nFix Version: 1:2.20.1-2+deb10u9\nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:10\nLink: [CVE-2023-25652](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2023-25652)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2023-25652**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | git  | 1:2.20.1-2+deb10u8  | 1:2.20.1-2+deb10u9  | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:10  | [CVE-2023-25652](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2023-25652)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/debian/git@1%3A2.20.1-2%2Bdeb10u8?arch=amd64\u0026distro=debian-10"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5"
              }
            },
