              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2019-18348\nSeverity: low\nPackage: libpython2.7-minimal\nVersion: 2.7.16-2+deb10u2\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:10\nLink: [CVE-2019-18348](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2019-18348)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2019-18348**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| low  | libpython2.7-minimal  | 2.7.16-2+deb10u2  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:10  | [CVE-2019-18348](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2019-18348)  |\n"
