                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-21714\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: node\nVersion: 16.20.2\nFix Version: 20.20.2,22.22.2,24.14.1,25.8.2\nType: binary\nLocation: /usr/local/bin/node\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2026-21714](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-21714)",
