              "id": "CVE-2018-20673-binutils",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2018-20673 low vulnerability for binutils package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The demangle_template function in cplus-dem.c in GNU libiberty, as distributed in GNU Binutils 2.31.1, contains an integer overflow vulnerability (for \"Create an array for saving the template argument values\") that can trigger a heap-based buffer overflow, as demonstrated by nm."
              },
