            {
              "id": "CVE-2020-35495-binutils",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2020-35495 low vulnerability for binutils package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "There's a flaw in binutils /bfd/pef.c. An attacker who is able to submit a crafted input file to be processed by the objdump program could cause a null pointer dereference. The greatest threat from this flaw is to application availability. This flaw affects binutils versions prior to 2.34."
              },
